  "details": "Copying this from discord:\n\nThe reason I go against the Mic Icon being in audio is because the first instinct when configuring the HUD is going into User Interface in the settings since its part of the UI. Since its not there, people would either try to search through every section or search for it in the Search box.\n\nNow, people can counter-argue and say \"well the search box exist for a reason\" and yes they will be correct. However, something like re-aligning the mic icon position should be something that would be in the User Interface section because that's the first thing users would go to when configuring this setting. Remember the description of the section in the launch pad is \"Adjust your microphone and audio settings\", while the settings is \"Adjust settings for UI, accessibility, and more\". And again, the first instinct when changing the mic position would be to go to UI Elements",
